OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for 300 homes in town set for
OL,4,Aapproval
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for up to 300 homes in Coalville
OL,7,Fare set to be given the go-ahead.
OL,9,FNorth West Leicestershire District
OL,10,FCouncil's planning committee has been
OL,11,Fadvised to approve a planning
OL,12,Fapplication on 28 October from Barwood
OL,13,FDevelopment Securities Ltd to build a
OL,14,Fhousing development on land off Broom
OL,15,FLeys Road and Stephenson Way.
OL,17,FAccording to planning documents, the
OL,18,Fproposals received 50 letters of
OL,19,Frepresentation, which raised concerns
OL,20,Fincluding increased congestion and
OL,21,Fextra pressure on public services in
OL,22,Fthe area.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
